  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2608.05 Immediate Suspension.\n\n(a) The commissioner shall immediately suspend the license to market or sell display and consumer fireworks, permissible fireworks, or both, if after receipt of a complaint, an investigation indicates that a licensee:\n\n(1) Has violated Saf-C 2608.02 and such violation results in jeopardizing public health, safety, or welfare;\n\n(2) Pursuant to RSA 160-B:14, has violated RSA 160-B or any rules adopted pursuant to that chapter; or\n\n(3) Pursuant to RSA 160-C:8, has violated RSA 160-C or any rules adopted pursuant to that chapter.\n\n(b) Any person whose license is suspended pursuant to this section or RSA 160-C:8 or RSA 160-B:14 shall be given the opportunity for a hearing within 10 days of the suspension.\n\n(c) The scheduling of a hearing shall not delay, postpone, or otherwise interrupt the suspension.\n\n(d) All hearings shall be conducted in accordance with Saf-C 203.\n\nSource. #10784, eff 2-13-15 (from Saf-C 2607.07)\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRULE | STATUTE\n\nSaf-C 2601.01 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2601.02 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2601.03 | RSA 541-A:7, RSA 160-B:6 and RSA 160-C:3\n\nSaf-C 2602.01 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2602.02 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2602.03 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2602.04 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2602.05 | RSA 160-B:1, IV; RSA 160-C:1, I\n\nSaf-C 2602.06 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2602.07 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2602.08 | RSA 160-B:1, IX; RSA 160-C:1, II\n\nSaf-C 2602.09 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2602.10 | RSA 160-B:1, V\n\nSaf-C 2602.11 | RSA 160-B:1, X; RSA 160-C:1, III\n\nSaf-C 2602.12 | RSA 160-B:1, I; RSA 160-C:1, IV\n\nSaf-C 2602.13 & Saf-C 2602.14 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2602.15 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2602.16 | RSA 160-C:1, V\n\nSaf-C 2602.17 & Saf-C 2602.18 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2602.19 | RSA 21:9\n\nSaf-C 2602.20 | RSA 160-B:1, VII; RSA 160-C:1, VI\n\nSaf-C 2602.21 | RSA 160-B:1, VI; RSA 160-C:1, VII\n\nSaf-C 2602.22 | RSA 160-B:1, VIII\n\nSaf-C 2603.01 – Saf-C 2603.04 | RSA 160-B:8, IV\n\nSaf-C 2603.05 & Saf-C 2603.06 | RSA 160-B:8, IV, RSA 158:9-f, I(a),(c); RSA 160-C:4, II\n\nSaf-C 2604.01-Saf-C 2604.07 | RSA 160-B:12\n\nSaf-C 2605.01 | RSA 160-B:2, I(c)\n\nSaf-C 2605.02 & Saf-C 2605.03 | RSA 160-B:2, I(c); RSA 160-B:6,I\n\nSaf-C 2605.04 | RSA 160-B:6\n\nSaf-C 2605.05 | RSA 160-B:6, II\n\nSaf-C 2605.06 & Saf-C 2605.07 | RSA 160-B:6 & RSA 541-A:29\n\nSaf-C 2605.08 | RSA 160-B:6, II\n\nSaf-C 2605.09 | RSA 160-B:6, VI\n\nSaf-C 2606.01(a) | RSA 160-C:2\n\nSaf-C 2606.01(b) | RSA 160-C:3, II-b\n\nSaf-C 2606.01(c) | RSA 158:9-f, II\n\nSaf-C 2606.01(d) | RSA 160-B:7, III & RSA 158:9-f, I(b)\n\nSaf-C 2606.02 & Saf-C 2602.03 | RSA 160-C:3, I\n\nSaf-C 2606.04 | RSA 160-C:3\n\nSaf-C 2606.05-Saf-C 2606.07 | RSA 160-C:3, II; RSA 541-A:29\n\nSaf-C 2606.08 | RSA 160-C:3, II\n\nSaf-C 2607.01 | RSA 160-C:3, IV\n\nSaf-C 2607.02 – Saf-C 2607.04 | RSA 160-C:4, V\n\nSaf-C 2607.05 | RSA 160-C:12\n\nSaf-C 2607.06 | RSA 160-C:4, V\n\nSaf-C 2607.07 | RSA 160-C:10\n\nSaf-C 2608.01-Saf-C 2608.04 | RSA 541-A:16, I(b)(2); RSA 541-A:30-a\n\nSaf-C 2608.05 | RSA 160-B:14; RSA 160-C:8 and RSA 541-A:30, III",
